---
layout: base.njk
title: null
description: Writing and data visualisation — timelines, charts, and the wider context.
---

<div class="wrap">

  <section class="hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
    <h1>Things don't happen in a vacuum.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Events are easier to understand next to what else was going on. This site
      collects a few threads worth following, and puts them on a shared axis.
    </p>
  </section>

  <div class="grid grid-2">
    {% for s in site.sections %}
    <a class="card card-link" href="{{ s.url | url }}">
      <p class="eyebrow">Section</p>
      <h3>{{ s.title }}</h3>
      <p>{{ s.blurb }}</p>
      <span class="card-cta">Open {{ s.title | lower }} &rarr;</span>
    </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>

</div>
